{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16072","headline":"送吴郎中赴忠州 · 王建","name":"送吴郎中赴忠州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西台复南省，清白上天知。\n家每因穷散，官多爲直移。\n遥边过驿近，买药出城迟。\n朝野凭人别，亲情伴酒悲。\n故园愁去後，白发想回时。\n何处忠州界，山头卓望旗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16072.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16072","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}